{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Bag-of-Words Representation.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Bag-of-Words Representation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"bag of words representation bag of words representation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Bag-of-Words Representation.md","fileName":"Bag-of-Words Representation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Bag-of-Words Representation","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-16 01:05\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Text Feature Representation]] · [[Text Analytics Philosophy and Methods]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Text Feature Representation","Text Analytics Philosophy and Methods","Text Tokenization","Automated Content Analysis","featureengineeringformachinelearninganddataanalytics.pdf","frontiersofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Bag-of-Words Representation.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Bag-of-Words Representation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"bag of words representation bag of words representation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Bag-of-Words Representation.md","fileName":"Bag-of-Words Representation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Bag-of-Words Representation","heading":"Bag-of-Words Representation","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A bag-of-words representation maps a document to a sparse vector of word counts or weights and discards word order. Documents using similar vocabulary receive similar vectors even when their sentences arrange the words differently.\n\nThis loss of structure is also the representation's strength: it is easy to construct, memory-efficient with sparse storage, robust across topics, and effective for many retrieval and categorization tasks. It struggles when meaning depends on order, phrases, or compositional syntax.\n\nIn automated content 